// logos.std.deem — INCREMENTAL DATAFLOW (ADR 0013 slices 1-4): ZBatch, FactStore change-capture, the ZOut signed-weight output, IncrJoin (join/anti/aggregate maintenance), Query::incremental.
// One package across several files (see deem.logos for the module-level doc);
// private items are package-visible, so the split is layout-only.
package logos.std.deem;


